        {
          "id": "p1-1",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "夜里，小狐狸坐在松树下，看见月亮挂在山的那一边。",
          "audio": null,
          "textEn": "At night, the little fox sat under the pine tree and saw the moon over the mountain.",
          "speakerEn": "Narrator"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-2",
          "speaker": "小狐狸",
          "text": "它看起来好近呀，我要去把它摘下来。",
          "audio": null,
          "textEn": "It looks so close! I will go and pick it.",
          "speakerEn": "Little Fox"
        }
      ],
